[{"title":"画鹰二首 其二","author":"陈琏","text":"木落空山静，秋风肃羽毛。\n雄心思击搏，狐兔竟何逃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50071,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题祝太仆红梅","author":"陈琏","text":"竹外见南枝，人间春几许。\n好风天上来，吹落胭脂雨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50072,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朱仙镇","author":"陈琏","text":"因过朱仙镇，英雄想岳王。\n传闻耕地者，曾见绿沉枪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50073,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望华山遇雨二首 其一","author":"陈琏","text":"昨日关东来，思与华山遇。\n如何风雨中，云深不知处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50074,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望华山遇雨二首 其二","author":"陈琏","text":"华山高崔嵬，云气自来往。\n只见巫女峰，难辨仙人掌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50075,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"箕山二首 其一","author":"陈琏","text":"停骖望箕山，山色翠欲滴。\n美人招不来，清风满泉石。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50076,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"箕山二首 其二","author":"陈琏","text":"初喜见箕山，复欣饮颍水。\n弃瓢更何人，忽忆隐君子。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"r