hor":"陈琏","text":"六堂寂寂夜将分，睡鸭烟消换宿薰。\n月照小窗清似水，匡床对坐好论文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50115,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀神乐观道士邓能宗二首 其一","author":"陈琏","text":"月下焚香礼紫微，露华凉透五铢衣。\n肃然风动神君至，常见空中白鸐飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50116,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀神乐观道士邓能宗二首 其二","author":"陈琏","text":"几年学道住瑶京，邂逅相逢慰我情。\n琳馆别来将半载，梦中犹忆紫箫声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50117,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赵松雪兰蕙图","author":"陈琏","text":"王孙绝艺世咸誇，爱写兰花与蕙花。\n楚畹于今谁复见，春风芳草暗天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50118,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马图","author":"陈琏","text":"九逵驰道惯腾骧，牧向郊原暂脱缰。\n新水溶溶春草绿，风光宛似华山阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50119,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郡斋偶成","author":"陈琏","text":"棠阴满地藓花斑，官舍无私白昼闲。\n惟有悯农心最切，日瞻云气起丰山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50120,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赏菊花和祝太仆韵","author":"陈琏","text":"莫道秋光不入时，寒芳满径露盈枝。\n平生自有中黄色，肯愧陶潜五字诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50121,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴丁二太仆送马之京七首 其一","author":"陈琏","text":"午夜房星映上台，天闲十二总龙媒。\n况逢四海升平日，常见神驹入贡来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50122,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴丁二太仆送马之京七首 其二","author":"陈琏","text":"明时牧马总名騧，江北江南十万家。\n太仆年年亲选贡，肯教神骏困盐车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50123,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴丁二太仆送马之京七首 其三","author":"陈琏","text":"周家国马生秦陇，汉代名驹出月氏。\n争似天朝群厩盛，骅骝百万总权奇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50124,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴丁二太仆送马之京七首 其四","author":"陈琏","text":"昔闻骏骨出蒲梢，今见龙驹满近郊。\n牧监奚官解调习，春风花外响鸣鞘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50125,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴丁二太仆送马之京七首 其五","author":"陈琏","text":"晓进神驹玉作蹄，花边露湿锦障泥。\n圉人牵过金阶上，似畏天颜不敢嘶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50126,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴丁二太仆送马之京七首 其六","author":"陈琏","text":"满身汗血是龙驹，逸气淩云画不如。\n从此便归天厩养，好骖玉辂驾鸾舆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50127,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴丁二太仆送马之京七首 其七","author":"陈琏","text":"都门骥子日成群，望处浑疑五色云。\n蕃息数增千百万，愿言上奏圣明君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50128,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿来安驿听雨偶成","author":"陈琏","text":"茅檐彻夜雨潇潇，枕簟生凉暑气消。\n自是思亲不成寐，非干窗外有芭蕉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50129,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"公廨前梅花开戏作二首 其一","author":"陈琏","text":"孤根生长近黄堂，烂熳花从雪里芳。\n政喜巡檐闲索笑，风情应不让何郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50130,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"公廨前梅花开戏作二首 其二","author":"陈琏","text":"霜雪纷纷万木衰，忽从竹外见南枝。\n凭君莫作寻常看，金鼎调羹事可期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50131,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赤壁图","author":"陈琏","text":"长江风静碧波平，一叶扁舟载月明。\n半夜矶头孤鹤唳，梦回犹听洞箫声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50132,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黑葡萄","author":"陈琏","text":"满架繁阴绿雾匀，夜深珠馆月华新。\n几回忆侍金銮殿，马乳堆盘出赐频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50133,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画菜","author":"陈琏","text":"纷纷甲第厌膏梁，却羡春畦菜甲长。\n尽日图中看不足，数茎犹带墨花香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50134,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨竹","author":"陈琏","text":"扶疏清影落瑶坛，玉露无声翠羽寒。\n一夜小窗秋意足，西风吹老碧琅玕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50135,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒梁太师王彦章墓","author":"陈琏","text":"峨峨祠宇汶城西，古冢荒凉绿树齐。\n为爱太师忠节重，几回下马读残碑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50136,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜泊济宁","author":"陈琏","text":"太白楼头雁影遥，月明如水夜迢迢。\n芙蓉露冷银河落，忽听风前碧玉箫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50137,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮安舟中闻吴歌","author":"陈琏","text":"湖舟腔子闻应惯，二八佳人席上歌。\n此夜扁舟听更好，水平波静月明多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50138,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜泊广陵","author":"陈琏","text":"扁舟夜泊近芜城，何处箫声似凤鸣。\n二十馀桥今有几，碧空依旧月华明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50139,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八仙花","author":"陈琏","text":"一自琼花飞上天，无双亭子益凄然。\n仙姝去后花仍在，玉蕊争传是八仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50140,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿昌平驿怀三氏教授文时中","author":"陈琏","text":"京国南归才十日，停骖又喜宿昌平。\n不眠一夜怀知己，自起开帘看月明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50141,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"铜城道中望泰山","author":"陈琏","text":"岱岳仙都海内闻，祥鸾瑞鹤自成群。\n重寻灵迹知何日，极目天门隔綵云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50142,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发滁阳","author":"陈琏","text":"笑领徵书酒半酣，紫薇香露湿华缄。\n秋闱人物多□许，明月知谁步斗南。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50143,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和姚少师听松庵韵","author":"陈琏","text":"山近虚窗云气通，纷纷落叶堕阶红。\n可人一室清如□，坐听松号万壑风。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50144,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登吴山望会稽","author":"陈琏","text":"驻马吴山纵目初，西兴烟树翠扶疏。\n会稽咫尺无由到，何日来探禹穴书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50145,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访林逋遗址","author":"陈琏","text":"闻昔西湖处士家，春风绕屋种梅花。\n孤山依旧人何在，古木斜阳有暮鸦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50146,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三贤祠","author":"陈琏","text":"太守文章处士诗，高风遗爱系人思。\n太师葛岭空陈迹，不及孤山有古祠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50147,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六一泉","author":"陈琏","text":"欧子孤山原不到，泉名六一表怀贤。\n勤师已化坡仙老，留得高名世上传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50148,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登崇文楼望湖山","author":"陈琏","text":"崇文楼上倚阑干，万里乾坤眼界宽。\n昨夜湖中风雨过，西山翠色未曾乾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50149,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过临平偶成","author":"陈琏","text":"临平山下有人家，晓日瞳瞳绚绛霞。\n石鼓铜鱼今在否，世人犹自说张华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":50150,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]